{"resourceIdentifier":"3842","resourceName":"Sarkisla Biogas Power Plant","description":"Sarkisla Biogas Power Plant (hereafter referred to as the Project) is a biogas-to-energy project that involves methane capture through anaerobic digestion and utilization of methane for thermal energy and electricity generation via cogeneration units. The animal manure is collected from the neighboring animal farms with vacuum trucks and transferred to the biogas plant. Continuously stirred tank reactor (CSTR) type anaerobic digesters are used to capture methane-rich biogas. Biogas is then utilized in cogeneration units for heat and electricity generation. The thermal energy is utilized for heating anaerobic fermenters. The generated electricity is both used for internal electricity consumption and supplied to the national grid. \r\n\r\nThe project activity avoids methane emission through the above-mentioned capture and utilization processes. Furthermore, the project reduces CO2 emissions from fossil-fuel-based electricity generation by supplying biogas-based electricity to the national grid.\r\n\r\nThis project adopts the renewable crediting period of 7 years, twice renewable for a total of 21 years. The estimated average net annual emission reductions are 48,493 tCO2eq/y. Accordingly, the project is expected to generate 342,600 tCO2eq/y emissions reduction during the first crediting period.","location":{"latitude":39.342037,"longitude":36.367039},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-11-25","endExclusive":"2022-12-26","endInclusive":"2022-12-25"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3842"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"SİVAS"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"48943"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.D.,AMS-III.D."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"EcoLance Private Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"23/01/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 29/12/2020 - 28/12/2027"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=79463&IDKEY=9097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87l109579477","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_3842_17OCT2022.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-11-25T13:49:28.183Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=76364&IDKEY=k98klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8df105305956","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Sarkisla Biogas Power Plant- ID 3842-v4.1-150322.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-10-17T15:51:24.647Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=106336&IDKEY=fkjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909k146637344","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-v4.2-Sarkisla Biogas(ID3842)_04072023_Clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-01-23T08:01:27.383Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=81754&IDKEY=a903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdfa112738766","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"VCS-Registration-Representation-Sarkisla Biogas-ID3842-v4.1.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-12-29T12:05:21.